<mxCell id="erd-m04_2" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation: Crow&#x27;s Foot (Information Engineering), physical level&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Line ends: &lt;b&gt;||&lt;/b&gt; exactly one &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;o|&lt;/b&gt; zero or one &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;o&amp;lt;&lt;/b&gt; zero or many. A foreign key leaves its row on the left; the referenced key is entered on the right.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key (_id) &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; ObjectId reference &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; unique index &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;NN&lt;/b&gt; required (not null) &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;= x&lt;/b&gt; default value&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;json&lt;/i&gt; = embedded sub-document &amp;nbsp; &lt;i&gt;enum X&lt;/i&gt; = value restricted to the X list &amp;nbsp; dashed grey box = entity owned by another module" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="56" width="900" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
